<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Job Application Template</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; /* Using serif fonts as primary */
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  ul { list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">Laboratory Technologist – Mechanical Engineering</h1>
  <p>The American University in Dubai invites qualified applicants to apply for the position of <span data-field="job_title">{{ job_title }}</span>.</p>
  <p>The fundamental responsibility of this position is to provide technical assistance and support to mechanical engineering faculty and students, and to manage the Mechanical Engineering laboratories.</p>

  <div class="section-title">Principle Responsibilities:</div>
  <ul>
    <li>Operating conventional lathe, milling, and drilling machines in the Engineering machine shop;</li>
    <li>Knowledge in 3D printer operations and CNC machine technology;</li>
    <li>Competency in CAD software (specify SolidWorks and AutoCAD) and other mechanical engineering software;</li>
    <li>Ordering equipment and setting up new engineering labs;</li>
    <li>Maintaining, organizing, and replenishing lab supplies;</li>
    <li>Administering lab inventories and proposing improvements to the Mechanical Engineering labs;</li>
    <li>Supervising students and faculty in using the Engineering machine shop;</li>
    <li>Ensuring safety procedures and regulations in the Engineering machine shop;</li>
    <li>Troubleshooting equipment hardware and software problems;</li>
    <li>Coordinating equipment installation, repair, and maintenance with vendors;</li>
    <li>Assisting the professors during the lab sessions;</li>
    <li>Maintaining a fully functional classroom and laboratory environment;</li>
    <li>Modifying and developing technical lab manuals, instruction manuals, reference guides and safety documents;</li>
    <li>Performing other related duties as assigned by the Supervisor or anyone acting in his or her capacity.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="section-title">Competencies and Skills Used:</div>
  <ul>
    <li>Exposure or familiarity with the following fields:
      <ul>
        <li><span data-field="competency_field_1">{{ competency_field_1 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="competency_field_2">{{ competency_field_2 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="competency_field_3">{{ competency_field_3 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="competency_field_4">{{ competency_field_4 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="competency_field_5">{{ competency_field_5 }}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li><span data-field="skill_1">{{ skill_1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="skill_2">{{ skill_2 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="skill_3">{{ skill_3 }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <div class="section-title">Essential Qualifications:</div>
  <ul>
    <li><span data-field="qualification_1">{{ qualification_1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="qualification_2">{{ qualification_2 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="qualification_3">{{ qualification_3 }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <div class="section-title">Desired Additional Qualifications:</div>
  <ul>
    <li><span data-field="desired_qualification_1">{{ desired_qualification_1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="desired_qualification_2">{{ desired_qualification_2 }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <p>Applications will be accepted and evaluated until this position is filled.</p>
  <p>Interested applicants must submit the following requirements via email to <span data-field="application_email">{{ application_email }}</span>.</p>
  <p>(Please state the title of the position as the subject of the email)</p>
  <ul>
    <li><span data-field="required_document_1">{{ required_document_1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="required_document_2">{{ required_document_2 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="required_document_3">{{ required_document_3 }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>Alternatively, applicants can submit their application materials to the following postal address:</p>
    <p><strong><span data-field="hiring_manager_name">{{ hiring_manager_name }}</span></strong></p>
    <p><span data-field="department_name">{{ department_name }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="postal_address">{{ postal_address }}</span></p>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">No telephone calls please.</p>
  <p>While we thank all applicants for their interest, only those under consideration will be contacted for a follow-up interview.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <!-- This page structure is based on the second image, which seems to be a continuation or a separate section for submission details -->
  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p><strong>Submission Checklist:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li><span data-field="cv_status">{{ cv_status }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="transcript_status">{{ transcript_status }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="references_status">{{ references_status }}</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>